[00:17.58]Young man and young woman,
[00:21.22]do give your heart to me.
[00:24.96]My foe who now taunts me
[00:28.56]will then be made to see.
[00:32.52]Your youth and devotion
[00:35.61]to me you freely give;
[00:40.04]You show all the world
[00:43.02]that for me you really live.
[00:49.65](Chorus)
[00:49.80]Beloved son and precious daughter,
[00:55.72]Be wise and make my heart rejoice,
[01:04.64]That out of your own heart you serve me,
[01:11.74]And offer praise by your own choice.
[01:31.02]Rejoice and take pleasure
[01:34.38]in giving me your all,
[01:38.32]And though you may stumble,
[01:42.16]I’ll raise you if you fall.
[01:45.68]No matter who fails you
[01:49.20]or proves to be untrue,
[01:53.10]Take comfort in knowing
[01:56.60]I’ll always cherish you.
[02:01.79](Chorus)
[02:01.94]Beloved son and precious daughter,
[02:08.54]Be wise and make my heart rejoice,
[02:17.52]That out of your own heart you serve me,
[02:24.62]And offer praise by your own choice.
